```java
class Solution {
    public boolean isPowerOfThree(int n) {
        if (n <= 0) {
            return false;
        }
        while (n % 3 == 0) {
            n /= 3;
        }
        return n == 1;
    }
}
```

**Follow-up (without loops/recursion):**

```java
class Solution {
    public boolean isPowerOfThree(int n) {
        // 3^19 = 1162261463 is the largest power of 3 within 32-bit signed integer range
        return n > 0 && 1162261463 % n == 0;
    }
}
```

